></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">流れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ながれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">流动；水流；气流；人流；事物流动；时光流逝；潮流；趋势；倾向；事件的进程；步骤；程序；过程；散场后聚在一起的人群；血统；家系；流派；（金融）流当；止赎；没收（抵押品）；取消；撤销；漂泊；流浪；漫游</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78261\"><ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れは<ruby>池<rp>(</rp><rt>いけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>注<rp>(</rp><rt>そそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">溪流掉进池塘</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">流れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ながれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">流动；流淌（液体、时间等）；洇开（墨水等）；被冲走；被（水流）带走；漂流；漂浮（如云彩）；飘荡；流浪；传播（如谣言）；蔓延；流传；被听到（如音乐）；被播放；陷入（如懒散、绝望）；流逝；消逝；被传递；被取消；中止；（抵押品）成为死当；（权利）丧失；消失；被消除</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124072\"><ruby>当時<rp>(</rp><rt>とうじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はきれいな<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がこの<ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にも<ruby>流<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">当时纯净的水也被冲到河边</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">泣く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">なく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哭泣；流泪；啜泣；遭受苦难；为…所困扰；经历艰辛；勉强接受（无理要求、损失等）；忍痛承担；做出牺牲；有负盛名；声誉受损；蒙羞；哀叹；悲叹；痛惜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><sp